### Test Staff Payment Endpoint Fix

### 1. Test staff tạo payment URL với propertyId
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/payment/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "amount": 500000,
  "returnUrl": "{{returnUrl}}",
  "cancelUrl": "{{cancelUrl}}",
  "note": "Admin tạo booking với VNPay"
}

### 2. Test staff tạo payment URL không có propertyId (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/payment/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "vnpay",
  "amount": 500000,
  "returnUrl": "{{returnUrl}}",
  "cancelUrl": "{{cancelUrl}}",
  "note": "Admin tạo booking với VNPay"
}

### 3. Test với MoMo payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/payment/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": "momo",
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "amount": 500000,
  "returnUrl": "{{returnUrl}}",
  "cancelUrl": "{{cancelUrl}}",
  "note": "Admin tạo booking với MoMo"
}

### Expected Results:
# - Endpoint trả về payment URL thành công
# - Không còn lỗi "returnUrl must be a URL address"
# - propertyId là bắt buộc
# - Hỗ trợ cả VNPay và MoMo

### Variables cho test
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @authToken = your_jwt_token_here
# @bookingId = your_booking_id_here
# @propertyId = your_property_id_here
# @returnUrl = http://localhost:5173/admin/bookings?payment=success&bookingId=your_booking_id
# @cancelUrl = http://localhost:5173/admin/bookings?payment=cancel&bookingId=your_booking_id
